  "note": "Edge-authored. Display name YC App Review (published 2026-10-30 as application-review, renamed the same day, split from yc-app-roast the same day). Builds a shareable one-file review page (application-portal look) where reviewers leave notes per question and a general note, and send them back as text that scripts/parse_notes.py reads; proposes rewrites from the notes. Optional: tracked private links via the Edge review service. The roast (scores, top issue, rewrite per answer) moved to yc-app-roast.",
